1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:02,466
Profit's up. Will the bank lend?

2
00:00:02,586 --> 00:00:05,412
Profit's up twenty percent. The bank should be easy.

3
00:00:05,532 --> 00:00:08,645
Banks are repaid from cash, not profit.

4
00:00:08,765 --> 00:00:10,425
Isn't that the same thing?

5
00:00:10,545 --> 00:00:14,092
Not when customers take ninety days to pay.

6
00:00:14,212 --> 00:00:16,361
In our view, that's a myth.

7
00:00:16,481 --> 00:00:24,065
Banks look at profit, but lend on the cash that repays the loan.

8
00:00:24,185 --> 00:00:29,229
Our banking & financing advisory prepares the cash flow view.

9
00:00:29,349 --> 00:00:33,699
Facility review coming up? Talk to us first.
